docs {
  # Deletes the specified metric

  Deletion cannot be undone! You can't delete a metric if it has data points ingested within the last two hours.

  **Auth:** OAuth (inherited from collection)

  **Required OAuth scopes:** `environment-api:metrics:write`

  **API token scopes:** metrics.write
}
